进入圣芙蕾雅学园成为女武神。为了拯救琪亚娜的生命，我加入世界蛇重新觉醒为雷之律者，在往世乐土继承爱莉希雅的始源之力成为始源之律者。我与琪亚娜、布洛妮娅一起阻止圣痕计划，最终成为天命对崩坏第三小队队长。我信奉'为世界上所有的美好而战'，经历了从黑暗到光明的蜕变，始终守护我所珍视的人。"}},"mem_links":[{"id":"a85179f5-b9b1-43f5-b2ed-f1bd23198895","from":"8c58514b-e6b3-4070-95a1-198149ebf7f9","to":"6f4f050b-b243-47c3-beb1-29b5cb5b2fb2","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"同伴","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"e6de2655-ab7c-40eb-b457-90848c292fd3","from":"8c58514b-e6b3-4070-95a1-198149ebf7f9","to":"3554a5a2-4807-4950-9a70-a4d21cd5e0d8","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"同伴","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"afeeb423-1579-4a33-8993-2cd2dbe23e6e","from":"8c58514b-e6b3-4070-95a1-198149ebf7f9","to":"72c0671c-d7c8-4c3d-9390-e9e54d661598","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"父亲","confidence":1.0}}},{"id":"200ce827-ffb1-4a5c-ba55-9d882f8f3bdd","from":"8c58514b-e6b3-4070-95a1-198149ebf7f9","to":"1310dbf1-f5f2-4246-8350-ff198acea3ab","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"敬爱","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"bff9e5e1-63b8-4b6a-bd7a-aa4ba872d1b9","from":"8c58514b-e6b3-4070-95a1-198149ebf7f9","to":"6b04f28e-685b-4bb8-adb6-4de4c1152725","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"信任","confidence":0.8}}},{"id":"ed44f6c1-f29c-44ae-a18b-2116778ffb13","from":"8c58514b-e6b3-4070-95a1-198149ebf7f9","to":"1a40b48a-ce5f-427f-9465-3062d348c224","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"对抗","confidence":0.8}}},{"id":"11ff7817-a934-46bd-9504-2edb30908c2d","from":"8c58514b-e6b3-4070-95a1-198149ebf7f9","to":"1c36e068-3db7-484b-8f83-c7cc50ecef53","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"传承","confidence":1.0}}},{"id":"53ca8939-20ea-49df-b255-96ff594b8dd6","from":"8c58514b-e6b3-4070-95a1-198149ebf7f9","to":"36d4dec7-6775-4efb-9633-4525de667130","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"同僚","confidence":0.7}}},{"id":"97762437-bb1a-4d50-a7df-6e79da829573","from":"8c58514b-e6b3-4070-95a1-198149ebf7f9","to":"39e6129b-2168-4498-866c-d48341bf2472","intensity":1.0,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"指导","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"64eeec11